message: >-
  If you use this software or the processed SWOT data products, please cite
  it as below. This work is supported by NSF Award 2527256, "Dynamic Modeling
  of River Ecosystem Stability."
title: SWOT River Dynamics Dashboard
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Stork
    given-names: Luke
    email: luke.stork@acres.com
repository-code: https://github.com/lukestork839/SWOT_Dashboard
url: https://swotdashboard-yk9ezgjahxvqjhmff767nu.streamlit.app/
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
keywords:
  - SWOT
  - remote sensing
  - hydrology
  - river avulsion
  - Kanektok River
  - Alaska
abstract: >-
  Ingestion, analysis, and interactive visualization of NASA SWOT satellite
  water-surface-elevation data for the Kanektok River and Uyak Creek near
  Quinhagak, Alaska, assessing avulsion risk by comparing hydraulic gradients
  between the two distributary channels.
